# To run exercise 1:
Get the dog and cats dataset from:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/bhavikjikadara/dog-and-cat-classification-dataset

Put a sample image in test_images folder

Set the following variables within ex1.py file:
RETRAIN = True (to train the models, otherwise False if weights folder is available)

DEMO_IMG  = path to the test image

Output images will be available in outputs folder

According to comparison.png:
in most cases (see attached examples) SRCNN super-resolution algorithm yields the best restoration results.

Super resolution Algorithms:
EDSR repo: https://github.com/sanghyun-son/EDSR-PyTorch
ESPCN repo: https://github.com/leftthomas/ESPCN
SRCNN repo: https://github.com/yjn870/SRCNN-pytorch

